      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The sales and quoting process was outstanding—fast responses and extremely helpful with any questions. The customer service throughout was excellent!Although the installation turned out to be a bit more challenging than initially expected, the team worked hard to ensure everything was completed. They returned several times, working around their other commitments, which I really appreciated. The team was always exceptionally polite, punctual, and professional.The team also took care of the grid connection and gave me a quick overview of the app, which provides analytical data for the system. While the walkthrough at the end felt like a lot of information to take in, after using the app a few times, it all starts to make sense and is actually easy to navigate.Overall, I’m really pleased with the service and the outcome",
