      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "For a start Leon and team from Zohras provided a link to quotes and followed up with a chat to explain the quotes so I know how to choose which system.The subsequent installation was done promptly and professionally without any delay or issues by a separate team of installers on panels and systems. Ahmed came to the house prior to the installation to ensure there is a suitable location for the batteries and Gateway/Inverter.Whem the installation was done, within the day, the Sigenergy system comes with an App with fantastic diagrams that explain where the electricity is generated, stored, consumed and exported and the time of day and night when all these are happening. It is a fantastic app.Ahmed has been a key person in the above steps. He showed me how to setup the app and how it works, even though it is pretty self explanatory. He really put in the care and effort in ensuring you have a functional system and are comfortable with the system before he leaves.Any subsequent questions and follow up, Ahmed and Leon are super prompt in getting back to me, even in the midst of their other installation tasks and schedule. For that I really appreciated I have a great post sales experience. I look forward to learning more from and supported by the Zohras team and be rewarded by the great system they recommended.Thank you Ahmed, Leon and Zohras team.SincerelyYow Wai Fong",
