      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Hi,I am forever indebted to you for introducing me to Zohras Clean Energy, I was tossing up between another company and Zohras Clean Energy.The other company was 3k more cheaper, however after meeting the installer from Zohras Clean Energy and going around my property (I have a new build) I was very comfortable with this installer, he explained everything to me in black and white. He explained where the conduits will go where the batter will sit, he left no stone unturned.After the install I had a slight problem with the system, I kid you not I rang the installer and within 25min he was at my house and the problem was solved in 3 Min. I have not had any problems since then, the installer msgs me every now and again to see if everything is OK. I am very very happy, this is one of the smartest decisions I have made thanks to you.My install (Single phase)19.5kwh solar panels12kwh Sig energy inverter3x 8kwh battery's.I have been trying to get solar installed for over 12 months, I didn't do it because evry one I spoke to suggested a different idea.I found Solar Quotes who made the entire process seamless. Thank you",
