      "review_description": "Ahmed from Zohra's Clean Energy was the only installer who came on site doing pre-inspection and working out a plan for suitable location of the battery and hybrid inverter. The other competitors only provided phone call and email quotes. It was no brainer why I picked Zohras.The battery installation took two full days (weekend, yep... Saturday and Sunday!). Day 1: inverter and battery installation. Day 2: backup protection. Despite a couple glitches, Ahmed called Sungrow support and they managed to update the firmware remotely on both inverter and battery to fix the issue. Ahmed also installed small awning for battery protection free of charge!Also need to mention John Lee from the Sales Consultant who was willing to assist my queries and provided very competitive price.I strongly recommend this company!",
